means/quantiles. Conditional-on-success\n297:coupling-group, entity, contract/cohort, economic-date, shock-kind, draw-index),\n299:rational (integer+1/2)/2^64. Branch enumeration order is absent. Coupling groups\n328:| reconstruct | IR, ModelScope, view, solver_lock, budgets | HistoryFamily and cell coverage, witnesses/conflicts/unknowns |\n331:| bound | formula, query expression, domain, quantisation mode, solver/budget | certified bound/attainment or explicit Unknown/Unbounded |\n353:numerical metadata, never historical probabilities. These are adapter designs\n354:grounded in archived interfaces. Only Z3 is exercised by the reference checks.\n376:  metadata is retained separately from that nominal value. An uncertainty\n377:  interval additionally needs the declared rounding convention; scale alone\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
